{"seq":14,"slug":"accounting-fundamentals","title":"会计学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"economics-finance","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals","rating":{"composite":4.09,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.16,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"会计学基础-简介\">会计学基础 简介</h1><p>会计是商业世界的通用语言。无论你是技术创业者、产品经理，还是希望拓宽视野的软件工程师，理解会计的基本原理都能帮助你看懂企业如何运营、如何评估商业决策、如何阅读一份财务报告。会计不只是数字的记录，更是一套把经济活动结构化呈现的方法论——它和我们熟悉的数据结构不变式、事件日志、状态快照有着惊人的同构关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"适合读者与前置条件\">适合读者与前置条件</h2><p>本知识库面向<strong>非会计专业的技术从业者</strong>：工程师、产品经理、技术创业者、需要与财务团队协作的技术负责人。你不需要任何会计背景；只要具备基本的算术能力和商业常识即可上手。全程会用程序员熟悉的概念（数据库事务、不变式、diff、快照）作类比，并贯穿软件 / SaaS 行业的真实场景。</p>\n<p>唯一的&quot;软前置&quot;是：如果你打算把这里学到的比率分析用于投资判断，建议先了解时间价值的概念——参见兄弟 hub <a href=\"../investment-fundamentals/investment-basics/time-value-of-money\">投资基础 · 货币时间价值</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-vs-兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub vs 兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>经济金融大类下有 26 个 hub，几个相邻 hub 容易混淆，这里明确划清边界：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Hub</th>\n<th>关注问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>会计学基础（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>经济活动如何被<strong>记录、计量、报告</strong>？三张报表怎么读？</td>\n<td>提供&quot;原始数据怎么来&quot;的底座</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../corporate-finance/\">公司金融</a></td>\n<td>企业如何<strong>做财务决策</strong>（融资、投资、估值、资本结构）？</td>\n<td>用本 hub 产出的报表做决策输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../investment-fundamentals/\">投资基础</a></td>\n<td>投资者如何<strong>挑选与组合资产</strong>（风险收益、估值、配置）？</td>\n<td>复用本 hub 的比率与现金流分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../fintech-fundamentals/\">金融科技基础</a></td>\n<td>区块链、智能合约、支付清算的<strong>技术实现</strong>？</td>\n<td>清结算与本 hub 的复式记账同源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../financial-risk-management/\">金融风险管理</a></td>\n<td>如何<strong>度量与对冲</strong>市场 / 信用 / 流动性风险？</td>\n<td>偿债能力分析是其信用风险的入口</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一句话区分：<strong>本 hub 教你&quot;看懂账本和报表&quot;，公司金融教你&quot;用报表做决策&quot;，投资基础教你&quot;用报表挑标的&quot;。</strong> 报表分析是三者的共同语言，因此本 hub 是这条主线的第一站。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><p>全书分四章，从根基概念到综合应用层层递进。建议按顺序学习；若已有基础，可按下图按需切入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[第1章 财务会计&lt;br/&gt;记账的底层逻辑] --&gt; B[第3章 财务报表&lt;br/&gt;会计信息的输出]&#10;    A --&gt; C[第2章 管理会计&lt;br/&gt;面向内部决策]&#10;    B --&gt; D[第4章 财务分析&lt;br/&gt;报表的综合解读]&#10;    C --&gt; D&#10;    D -.延伸.-&gt; E[公司金融 / 投资基础]\">graph LR\n    A[第1章 财务会计&lt;br/&gt;记账的底层逻辑] --&gt; B[第3章 财务报表&lt;br/&gt;会计信息的输出]\n    A --&gt; C[第2章 管理会计&lt;br/&gt;面向内部决策]\n    B --&gt; D[第4章 财务分析&lt;br/&gt;报表的综合解读]\n    C --&gt; D\n    D -.延伸.-&gt; E[公司金融 / 投资基础]</pre><p><strong>第一章 财务会计</strong>建立核心概念框架：从<a href=\"financial-accounting/accounting-equation\">会计等式</a>这一根基出发，讲解<a href=\"financial-accounting/double-entry\">复式记账法</a>的运作逻辑、完整的<a href=\"financial-accounting/accounting-cycle\">会计循环</a>流程，以及最复杂的<a href=\"financial-accounting/revenue-recognition\">收入确认</a>五步法。这一章是理解整个会计体系的基石——务必先读。</p>\n<p><strong>第二章 管理会计</strong>转向企业内部视角：<a href=\"management-accounting/cost-accounting\">成本核算</a>如何追踪与分配成本、<a href=\"management-accounting/budgeting\">预算管理</a>如何把战略变成可执行的财务计划、<a href=\"management-accounting/variance-analysis\">差异分析</a>如何发现并纠正偏差。这一章对参与定价、资源分配、项目投资决策的技术管理者尤其有价值。</p>\n<p><strong>第三章 财务报表</strong>聚焦会计信息的最终输出形式：读懂<a href=\"financial-statements/balance-sheet\">资产负债表</a>（时点快照）、<a href=\"financial-statements/income-statement\">利润表</a>（期间记账）、<a href=\"financial-statements/cash-flow-statement\">现金流量表</a>（实际数钱），并掌握<a href=\"financial-statements/financial-ratios\">财务比率</a>这套通用工具箱。</p>\n<p><strong>第四章 财务分析</strong>把前三章汇聚到实战：<a href=\"financial-analysis/financial-ratios\">比率分析方法论</a>（如何选指标、与谁比）、<a href=\"financial-analysis/comprehensive-analysis\">三表联动综合分析</a>（哈佛框架、行业对标），以及<a href=\"financial-analysis/standards-and-auditing\">会计准则与审计</a>（IFRS/US GAAP/CAS 差异、内部控制、ITGC）。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>说明：第三章的「财务比率」是<strong>指标目录</strong>（每个比率是什么、怎么算），第四章的「比率分析方法论」是<strong>分析方法</strong>（如何成体系地选用、解读、对标），两者互补不重复，互相交叉引用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"这套知识如何帮到技术人\">这套知识如何帮到技术人</h2><ul>\n<li>设计财务系统 / ERP：会计等式是数据不变式，会计循环是核心工作流，试算平衡是数据完整性校验。</li>\n<li>创业与融资：看懂三张报表、自由现金流、烧钱速度，理解投资人为何盯着 ARR、LTV/CAC、Rule of 40。</li>\n<li>合规与安全：<a href=\"financial-analysis/standards-and-auditing\">会计准则与审计</a>一节专讲 SOX 合规与 IT 一般控制（ITGC），与软件工程的变更管理、访问控制直接对应。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"financial-accounting","title":"财务会计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-accounting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"accounting-equation","title":"会计等式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-accounting/accounting-equation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"double-entry","title":"复式记账法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-accounting/double-entry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"accounting-cycle","title":"会计循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-accounting/accounting-cycle"},{"seq":4,"slug":"revenue-recognition","title":"收入确认","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-accounting/revenue-recognition"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"management-accounting","title":"管理会计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/management-accounting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-accounting","title":"成本核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/management-accounting/cost-accounting"},{"seq":2,"slug":"budgeting","title":"预算管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/management-accounting/budgeting"},{"seq":3,"slug":"variance-analysis","title":"差异分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/management-accounting/variance-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-statements","title":"财务报表","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-statements","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"balance-sheet","title":"资产负债表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-statements/balance-sheet"},{"seq":2,"slug":"income-statement","title":"利润表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-statements/income-statement"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cash-flow-statement","title":"现金流量表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-statements/cash-flow-statement"},{"seq":4,"slug":"financial-ratios","title":"财务比率","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-statements/financial-ratios"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"financial-analysis","title":"财务分析","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-analysis","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"financial-ratios","title":"财务比率分析方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-analysis/financial-ratios"},{"seq":2,"slug":"comprehensive-analysis","title":"财务报表综合分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-analysis/comprehensive-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"standards-and-auditing","title":"会计准则与审计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/accounting-fundamentals/financial-analysis/standards-and-auditing"}]}]}